WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000 line:83%
Fortified House · Starting from an empty plot

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.200 line:83%
Lay the foundation with terrain tiles.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.900 line:83%
Raise the ground where the house will sit.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:11.000 line:83%
Lay a path and add steps to follow the slope.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:83%
Open Buildings and choose pieces from the catalog.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.850 line:83%
Place the walls, towers, and roofs.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:30.350 line:83%
Open Nature and place rocks around the house.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:38.000 line:83%
Add trees to finish the scene.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.500 line:83%
Moonlit Night

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.000 line:83%
Foggy Night

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.500 line:83%
